## Promotion gate

Do **not** promote `preparedCases` / playbook until:

- [ ] Coverage map exists in `docs/cases/case-NNN-*.md`
- [ ] Primary FA pages for chief concern have non-*(fill)* touches
- [ ] Bibliography links use `pdfPage1` where case bibliography popover is wired

## Agents

- Run **`first-aid-case-coverage.py`** on every new case capture — not optional
- Paraphrase FA in attending voice in JSON; no long verbatim paste into shipped `orderWhy`
- If index stale after PDF update: `npm run build:first-aid-index`
